  "description": "ToolUp.OpenXml.Spreadsheet — the SpreadsheetML write side: an immutable typed workbook model (sheets, rows, cells, cell values covering text / number / boolean / date-as-serial, number-format codes, column widths, merged ranges) with Emit.toBytes producing a valid .xlsx. Sheet names are validated against Excel's rules and returned as a recoverable Result rather than silently truncated, and emission is deterministic: two emits of the same model are byte-identical.",
